OL,3,ATrump faces backlash after saying he   
OL,4,A'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO    
OL,5,AJensen Huang                           
OL,7,FJensen Huang has been reinstated as the
OL,8,Fboss of Nvidia less than two weeks     
OL,9,Fafter he was forced to resign following
OL,10,Fthe revelations of extra marital       
OL,11,Faffairs, one of which was with a       
OL,12,Fsuspected Chinese spy.                 
OL,14,FThe AI chipmaker handed its co-founder 
OL,15,Fhis job back, despite rejecting his    
OL,16,Finitial offer to return, after pressure
OL,17,Ffrom US President Donald Trump.        
OL,19,FTrump said he "made the deal" with the 
OL,20,Ftech giant's board to get Huang his job
OL,21,Fback, but both the president and Nvidia
OL,22,Fare facing backlash from lawmakers.    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
