OL,3,ATrump faces backlash after saying he   
OL,4,A'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO    
OL,5,AJensen Huang                           
OL,7,FBut his comeback added almost $1       
OL,8,Ftrillion to Nvidia's market value as   
OL,9,Fits share price jumped 31%, ending     
OL,10,Fended a streak of losses on the US     
OL,11,Fstock market.                          
